# The bundled Noto Sans JP OFL texts are byte-identical copies of the upstream
# Google Fonts file (ofl/notosansjp/OFL.txt, 4,388 B), which contains one
# trailing space. Exempt only trailing-space from `git diff --check` (keeping
# the other whitespace rules active) and disable EOL conversion (-text) so
# `include_str!` embeds LF bytes even when core.autocrlf is enabled.
crates/eightbitdo-gui/assets/fonts/OFL.txt whitespace=-trailing-space -text
crates/eightbitdo-gui/assets/licenses/OFL-NotoSansJP.txt whitespace=-trailing-space -text
